cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Diagnosis of Alzheimer’s Disease Using Neural Networks
message: If you use this repository, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dalir Abdinia
    given-names: Niloofar
abstract: >
  Bachelor’s thesis implementation of a multilayer perceptron for
  binary classification of OASIS clinical records (Demented / Nondemented),
  with MRMR feature ranking and MATLAB plus Python code. This is a
  student research project, not a clinical diagnostic system.
keywords:
  - Alzheimer
  - neural networks
  - MLP
  - MRMR
  - OASIS
license: MIT
